le\";s:25:\"WooCommerce Subscriptions\";s:4:\"copy\";s:514:\"WooCommerce Subscriptions is a WooCommerce extension that lets customers subscribe to your products or services and pay on a weekly, monthly, or annual basis. It integrates with over 25 payment gateways for automatic recurring payments and supports automatic rebilling on failed subscription payments. Subscribers can manage their own plan — upgrading, downgrading, suspending, or canceling — and update their shipping address or payment method. It\'s a paid annual extension with a 30-day money-back guarantee.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:59:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/woocommerce-subscriptions/\";s:9:\"is_pinned\";b:1;}i:21;a:9:{s:4:\"slug\";s:45:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-composite-products\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:18:\"composite-products\";s:4:\"icon\";s:100:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/Composite_Products_icon-marketplace-160x160-1.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:18:\"Composite Products\";s:4:\"copy\";s:85:\"Create product kit builders and custom product configurators using existing products.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:52:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/composite-products/\";s:9:\"is_pinned\";b:1;}i:22;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:47:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-woocommerce-deposits\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:20:\"woocommerce-deposits\";s:4:\"icon\";s:90:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/Deposits_icon-marketplace-160x160-2.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:20:\"WooCommerce Deposits\";s:4:\"copy\";s:71:\"Enable customers to pay for products using a deposit or a payment plan.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:54:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/woocommerce-deposits/\";}i:23;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:42:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-dynamic-pricing\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:15