(136, 1, '2024-06-30 18:37:36', '2024-06-30 18:37:36', '<h2>Shipping Policy</h2>\r\n<h3>Shipping Details</h3>\r\nWe aim to dispatch your order within 24-48 hours from the nearest fulfillment center. For any questions or special requests, please reach out to us at info@jadespaceglobal.com, and we will respond promptly.\r\n<h3>Order Tracking</h3>\r\nOnce your order is assigned to a courier, you will receive a notification via SMS or email with the tracking number and the courier\'s name. Additionally, an invoice with the shipment details will be sent to your email.\r\n<h3>Returns</h3>\r\nTo return a product, please contact us for instructions at the provided email address. You will need to mail your return to the address included in the return instructions.\r\n<h3>Return Shipping Costs</h3>\r\nYou are responsible for the shipping costs when returning an item. These costs are non-refundable. If you receive a refund, the cost of return shipping will be deducted from your refund.\r\n<h3>Shipping Time for Exchanges</h3>\r\nThe delivery time for exchanged products may vary based on your location.\r\n<h3>High-Value Shipments</h3>\r\nFor items valued over Rs 10,000, we recommend using a trackable shipping service or purchasing shipping insurance. We do not guarantee the receipt of your returned item.', 'Shipping Policy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'shipping-policy', '', '', '2024-06-30 19:09:08', '2024-06-30 19:09:08', '', 0, 'https://jadespaceglobal.com/?page_id=136', 0, 'page', '', 0),
