(220, 1, '2024-07-03 20:02:43', '2024-07-03 20:02:43', '<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"n45zz7\" data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1738\">Premium Soft Close Magic Corner Organizer for Modular Kitchens</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"2090\">The <strong data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1792\">Jadespace Soft Close Magic Corner Swing Tray</strong> is an innovative storage solution that maximizes the functionality of blind corner cabinets in modern modular kitchens. Instead of wasting valuable corner space, this premium organizer allows the baskets to glide smoothly out of the cabinet, giving you complete access to items stored at the back.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2426\">Engineered with a <strong data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2150\">German-inspired soft-close mechanism</strong>, the swing trays move effortlessly and return gently without slamming. The <strong data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2245\">anti-skid trays</strong> help keep cookware, jars, bottles, and containers securely in place during operation, while the powder-coated steel frame provides outstanding strength and long-lasting durability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2690\">Designed for <strong data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2466\">900mm corner cabinets</strong> (recommended corner width <strong data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2507\">900–1050mm</strong>), this organizer supports up to <strong data-start=\"2540\" data-end=\"2548\">30kg</strong> and is ideal for storing heavy kitchen items such as pressure cookers, pots, pans, mixer jars, groceries, oil bottles, and pantry essentials.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2833\">Its sleek modern design, corrosion-resistant finish, and user-friendly operation make it a perfect addition to contemporary modular kitchens.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>About this item</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Cabinet width 900 mm swing corner WIDTH 810* DEPTH 480* HEIGHT (600-770)MM | Product Dimensions: 48D x 80W x (60-77) H Centimeters</li>\r\n 	<li>Suggested Corner Width 900 -1050 mm, Required minimum Opening Door Cabinet Space of 450 mm, Required length - 500 mm (Please Check Your Size Before Buy) . Also , pls check Left &amp;amp; right side opening of yours before buy.</li>\r\n 	<li>Cabinet Door Width : 450mm (Outer) Cabinet Width : 900 mm (Outer) 30 Kg Load capacity. Can be fiited in 16\" door also if your carpenter is experienced.</li>\r\n 	<li>Special Features:-Corrosion And Rust Free,High Durability Soft close. Easy installation with Installation Templates &amp;amp; Guide.</li>\r\n 	<li>Suggested Corner Width 900 -1050 mm, Required minimum Opening Door Cabinet Space of 450 mm, Required length - 500 mm (Please check size before buy) Item. Kitchen Magic Corner Soft Close Left Side Swing Tray. Corner units have taken a turn for the better. These accessories are used to optimize maximum space of your kitche\'s corner.A corner unit is the ideal place to store parts and pans, mixers and other kitchen equipment</li>\r\n 	<li>It is modern &amp;amp; stylish accessories to give your kitchen an exclusive look and user friendly</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Jadespace Soft Close Magic Corner Swing Tray – Right Side | 900mm Kitchen Corner Cabinet Organizer | Anti-Skid Trays | 30kg Load Capacity', 'Transform unused corner cabinets into smart storage with the <strong data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1289\">Jadespace Soft Close Magic Corner Swing Tray</strong>. Designed for <strong data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1345\">900mm modular kitchen corner cabinets</strong>, this premium organizer features <strong data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1404\">soft-close technology</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1433\">anti-skid storage trays</strong>, and a <strong data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1476\">heavy-duty rust-resistant frame</strong>. Its smooth swing-out mechanism brings hidden storage within easy reach, making it ideal for storing cookware, pots, pans, groceries, and kitchen essentials.\r\n<table class=\"table table-borderless table-sm\"><!--\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Code</th>\r\n<th>Operation</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n-->\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Brand</td>\r\n<td></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Product Dimensions</td>\r\n<td>48D x 80W x 77H Centimeters</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Item Weight</td>\r\n<td>15 Kilograms</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Assembly Required</td>\r\n<td>No</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'soft-close-swing-corner', '', '', '2026-07-26 14:16:30', '2026-07-26 14:16:30', '', 0, 'https://jadespaceglobal.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=220', 0, 'product', '', 0),
