(482, 1, '2026-07-26 14:29:13', '2026-07-26 14:29:13', '<h4></h4>\n<h4><strong>Abo</strong></h4>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"154rf8s\" data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1704\">Premium Bi-Fold Lift System for Modern Overhead Cabinets</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1914\">Upgrade your modular kitchen with the <strong data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1790\">Jadespace Bi-Fold Lift Up Overhead Fitting</strong>, a high-performance hydraulic cabinet lift system engineered for smooth, effortless operation and long-lasting reliability.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"2229\">Unlike conventional cabinet hinges, the bi-fold lift mechanism folds the cabinet door upward into two sections, allowing unobstructed access to the cabinet without occupying extra space. This makes it an excellent choice for overhead kitchen cabinets, utility cabinets, pantry units, and modern storage furniture.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2626\">The advanced <strong data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2279\">hydraulic soft-close technology</strong> ensures silent and controlled opening and closing, preventing sudden impacts and extending the life of your cabinet doors. The <strong data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2435\">power adjustment feature</strong> allows the lifting force to be fine-tuned according to the weight of the shutter, while the <strong data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2561\">vertical adjustment mechanism</strong> enables alignment corrections without removing the cabinet door.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2886\">Designed for <strong data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2661\">11–12kg shutters</strong>, the system provides exceptional stability even on wide cabinet doors. It is compatible with both <strong data-start=\"2760\" data-end=\"2779\">wooden shutters</strong> and <strong data-start=\"2784\" data-end=\"2816\">aluminium-framed glass doors</strong>, making it suitable for premium residential and commercial interiors.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2888\" data-end=\"3101\">The complete set includes a <strong data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2966\">pair of lift mechanisms with decorative covers</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"2989\">auto-close hinges</strong>, and a <strong data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3043\">centre hinge with installation accessories</strong>, ensuring everything needed for installation is included.</p>\n\n<h4><strong>ut this item</strong></h4>\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Bi-FOLD/DOUBLE LIFT UP OVERHEAD FITTING</span></li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Ideally used for the kitchen overhead cabinets where the entire cabinet space can be utilized.</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Smooth shutter opening &amp; closing</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Elegant Look suiting modern kitchens</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Vertical adjustment without removing shutter</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Power Adjustment Feature</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Set Comprises (Lift-up mechanism with cover: 01 pair ; Auto close hinge: 01 pair  ; Center hinge with accessories)</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">High stability, even with wide doors</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Suitable for wooden &amp; framed glass doors</li>\n</ul>', 'Jadespace Bi-Fold Lift Up Overhead Fitting | Hydraulic Soft Close Cabinet Lift System | Double Lift-Up Mechanism | 11–12kg Capacity | Modular Kitchen Hardware', '<p>The <strong data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1150\">Jadespace Bi-Fold Lift Up Overhead Fitting</strong> is a premium hydraulic lift system designed for modern modular kitchen overhead cabinets. Featuring a <strong data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1285\">soft-close bi-fold mechanism</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1307\">power adjustment</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1342\">vertical alignment adjustment</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1378\">high-stability engineering</strong>, it allows cabinet shutters to fold upward smoothly, providing complete access to the cabinet interior while maintaining a clean, contemporary look. Suitable for <strong data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1584\">wooden and aluminium-framed glass doors</strong> weighing <strong data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1605\">11–12kg</strong>.</p><table class=\"table table-borderless table-sm mce-item-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Brand</td><td>Jadespace</td></tr><tr><td>SKU</td><td>MUL-509</td></tr><tr><td>Weight Capacity</td><td>6-8 Kg, 8-10 Kg, 10-12 Kg</td></tr></tbody></table>', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '479-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-07-26 14:29:13', '2026-07-26 14:29:13', '', 479, 'https://jadespaceglobal.com/?p=482', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(483, 1, '2024-09-05 19:56:25', '2024-09-05 19:56:25', '<h3 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1or93jv\" data-start=\"2623\" data-end=\"2660\">Multiple Force Options (60N–150N)</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2758\">Available in <strong data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2708\">60N, 80N, 100N, 120N, and 150N</strong> to suit different cabinet door sizes and weights.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"\" data-section-id=\"10oqgnd\" data-start=\"2760\" data-end=\"2793\">Smooth Hydraulic Lift Support</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2882\">Advanced hydraulic mechanism provides controlled lifting and soft, stable door movement.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4cm9sw\" data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2912\">Quiet &amp; Silent Operation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"3015\">Minimizes noise and prevents sudden door drops, creating a safer and more comfortable user experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"at6e0z\" data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3047\">Durable Metal Construction</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3144\">Manufactured from premium-grade steel for excellent strength, durability, and long service life.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8qlq7j\" data-start=\"3146\" data-end=\"3190\">Corrosion-Resistant Metallic Grey Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3290\">Protective finish resists rust, moisture, and daily wear, making it ideal for kitchen environments.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tix5v8\" data-start=\"3292\" data-end=\"3313\">Easy Installation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3314\" data-end=\"3406\">Supplied with standard mounting hardware for quick and secure installation on cabinet doors.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19jv3vr\" data-start=\"3408\" data-end=\"3443\">Supports Cabinet Door Longevity</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3528\">Reduces stress on hinges and cabinet frames by controlling door movement and impact.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14emj9t\" data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3555\">Universal Application</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3658\">Compatible with most modular kitchen cabinets, wardrobes, office cabinets, and overhead storage units.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>About this item</strong></h4>\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Ideally used for the kitchen overhead cabinets where the entire cabinet space can be utilized.</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Smooth shutter opening &amp; closing</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Suitable for wooden &amp; aluminium framed shutters</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Load Size: 60N, 80N, 100N, 120N, 150N</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Surface Color: Metallic Grey</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Easy installation</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"O2\">High durability</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Jadespace Hydraulic Gas Pump – Premium Hydraulic Lift Support for Kitchen Cabinets | 60N–150N | Soft Open Gas Spring | Easy Installation | Metallic Grey Finish', 'Upgrade your modular kitchen and wardrobe cabinets with the <strong data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1261\">Jadespace Premium Hydraulic Gas Pump</strong>. Designed for <strong data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1324\">smooth, controlled, and silent door movement</strong>, this high-performance lift support is available in <strong data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1411\">60N, 80N, 100N, 120N, and 150N</strong> force options. Featuring a durable metallic grey finish, corrosion-resistant construction, and easy installation, it is the ideal solution for overhead cabinet doors and flap lifts.\r\n<table class=\"table table-borderless table-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Brand</td>\r\n<td>Jadespace</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>SKU</td>\r\n<td>MUL - 508</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Weight Capacity</td>\r\n<td>60 Newton / 6 Kg</td>\r\n<td>80 Newton / 8 Kg</td>\r\n<td>100 Newton / 10 Kg</td>\r\n<td>120 Newton / 12 Kg</td>\r\n<td>150 Newton / 15 Kg</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'gap-pump', '', '', '2026-07-26 14:23:06', '2026-07-26 14:23:06', '', 0, 'https://jadespaceglobal.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=483', 0, 'product', '', 0),
