(515, 1, '2024-09-06 07:22:11', '2024-09-06 07:22:11', '<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1r5goau\" data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1526\">Smart Pull-Out Waste Bin for Modern Modular Kitchens</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1823\">The <strong data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1588\">Jadespace Plastic Kitchen Sliding Pull-Out Waste Bin</strong> is a practical and hygienic waste management solution designed for contemporary modular kitchens. Installed inside the cabinet, the pull-out design keeps the dust bin hidden from view, helping maintain a clean and uncluttered kitchen.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"2096\">Manufactured from high-quality, durable plastic in an elegant grey finish, the waste bin is lightweight, easy to clean, and built for daily use. The precision sliding mechanism allows smooth operation, making it easy to dispose of kitchen waste while cooking or cleaning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2281\">Designed for <strong data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2133\">250 × 452 × 365 mm</strong> dimensions and compatible with <strong data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2188\">254mm cabinet width</strong>, this pull-out dust bin is ideal for compact kitchens where space optimization is essential.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2463\">Whether you\'re disposing of vegetable peels, food scraps, packaging, or everyday household waste, the Jadespace Sliding Waste Bin offers a convenient, durable, and modern solution.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>About this item</strong></h4>\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Set includes metal frame with mechanism, ABS buckets and lid.</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Kitchen pullout built-in wastebin/dustbin for Undersink cabinet has 30 Litres capacity which is divided into 2 partitions with 15 litres capacity each &amp; with soft closing mechanism</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Removable bucket for convenience of cleaning.</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Full extension slides provided for easy access of the buckets.</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Elegantly designed to suit today’s modern kitchen.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Jadespace Plastic Pull-Out Kitchen Waste Bin – Grey | Cabinet Mounted Dust Bin | Soft Sliding Trash Bin | 250 × 452 × 365 mm | Fits 254mm Cabinet Width', 'Maintain a clean and organized kitchen with the <strong data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1154\">Jadespace Plastic Kitchen Sliding Pull-Out Waste Bin</strong>. Designed for <strong data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1192\">254mm cabinet width</strong>, this cabinet-mounted waste bin features a smooth sliding mechanism, durable plastic construction, and a space-saving pull-out design. Ideal for modern modular kitchens, it keeps waste concealed while providing quick and convenient access.\r\n<table class=\"table table-borderless table-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Brand</td>\r\n<td>Jadespace</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>SKU</td>\r\n<td>MKE - 0106</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Capacity</td>\r\n<td>30 Litres</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'pull-out-undersink-cabinet-wastebin', '', '', '2026-07-25 02:49:38', '2026-07-25 02:49:38', '', 0, 'https://jadespaceglobal.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=515', 0, 'product', '', 0),
