(545, 1, '2024-09-06 15:54:00', '2024-09-06 15:54:00', '<h1 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1xw2um3\" data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1770\">Detailed Product Description</h1>\r\n<h1 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"zjxypn\" data-start=\"4245\" data-end=\"4271\">Technical Specifications</h1>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4273\" data-end=\"4906\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"4273\" data-end=\"4300\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4273\" data-end=\"4300\">\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4273\" data-end=\"4289\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Specification</th>\r\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"4289\" data-end=\"4300\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"4328\" data-end=\"4906\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"4328\" data-end=\"4349\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4328\" data-end=\"4336\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Brand</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4336\" data-end=\"4349\" data-col-size=\"md\">Jadespace</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4350\" data-end=\"4395\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4350\" data-end=\"4365\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Product Name</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4365\" data-end=\"4395\" data-col-size=\"md\">Push to Open Drawer Slides</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4396\" data-end=\"4456\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4396\" data-end=\"4411\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Product Type</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4411\" data-end=\"4456\" data-col-size=\"md\">Full Extension Ball Bearing Drawer Runner</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4457\" data-end=\"4485\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4457\" data-end=\"4469\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Operation</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4469\" data-end=\"4485\" data-col-size=\"md\">Push to Open</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4486\" data-end=\"4528\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4486\" data-end=\"4503\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Extension Type</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4503\" data-end=\"4528\" data-col-size=\"md\">3-Fold Full Extension</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4529\" data-end=\"4570\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4529\" data-end=\"4540\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Material</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4540\" data-end=\"4570\" data-col-size=\"md\">High-Density Steel (1.2mm)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4571\" data-end=\"4617\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4571\" data-end=\"4580\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Finish</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4580\" data-end=\"4617\" data-col-size=\"md\">Electrophoretic Anti-Rust Coating</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4618\" data-end=\"4648\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4618\" data-end=\"4634\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Load Capacity</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4634\" data-end=\"4648\" data-col-size=\"md\">Up to 45kg</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4649\" data-end=\"4699\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4649\" data-end=\"4669\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Opening Mechanism</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4669\" data-end=\"4699\">Spring Rebound Push System</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4700\" data-end=\"4751\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4700\" data-end=\"4717\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Bearing System</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4717\" data-end=\"4751\" data-col-size=\"md\">Double-Row Steel Ball Bearings</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4752\" data-end=\"4792\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4752\" data-end=\"4769\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Drawer Removal</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4769\" data-end=\"4792\" data-col-size=\"md\">Quick Release Lever</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4793\" data-end=\"4851\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4793\" data-end=\"4811\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Available Sizes</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4811\" data-end=\"4851\">300, 350, 400, 450, 500, 550 &amp; 600mm</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4852\" data-end=\"4881\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4852\" data-end=\"4874\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corrosion Resistant</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4874\" data-end=\"4881\">Yes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"4882\" data-end=\"4906\">\r\n<td data-start=\"4882\" data-end=\"4899\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rust Resistant</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"4899\" data-end=\"4906\" data-col-size=\"md\">Yes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1rbasmx\" data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1837\">Premium Push-to-Open Drawer Runner System for Modern Furniture</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"2046\">The <strong data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1883\">Jadespace Push to Open Drawer Slides</strong> are designed for homeowners, interior designers, and furniture manufacturers who want a clean, minimalist, handleless appearance without compromising performance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2361\">Unlike traditional drawer channels, these runners feature a <strong data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2157\">high-performance spring-loaded push mechanism</strong> that instantly opens the drawer with a light press. Combined with <strong data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2261\">precision ball-bearing technology</strong>, the slides deliver exceptionally smooth and quiet movement throughout the drawer\'s full extension.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2700\">Manufactured from <strong data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2415\">1.2mm thick high-density steel</strong> with an <strong data-start=\"2424\" data-end=\"2461\">electrophoretic anti-rust coating</strong>, the slides provide outstanding strength, corrosion resistance, and durability. Engineered to withstand <strong data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2580\">up to 45kg</strong> of load and independently tested for <strong data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"2646\">100,000 operating cycles</strong>, they are built for years of dependable everyday use.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2845\">A built-in <strong data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2744\">quick-release locking lever</strong> makes drawer removal and reinstallation simple, making maintenance and cleaning fast and convenient.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"3083\">Available in multiple sizes (<strong data-start=\"2876\" data-end=\"2931\">300mm, 350mm, 400mm, 450mm, 500mm, 550mm, and 600mm</strong>), these drawer runners are suitable for modular kitchens, wardrobes, office furniture, bathroom vanities, TV units, study tables, and storage cabinets.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>About this item</strong></h4>\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">30 Year service life Please note: This is push to open drawer slide，no soft close.YENUO push open drawer slides which is durable.After testing, the number of times the slide rail is opened and closed is as high as 100,000 times.Installation dimension description：25mm space between drawer and cabinet wall required ( Left mounting clearance: 12.5mm, right mounting clearance: 12.5mm ).Suitable drawer length:300-350 mm.</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Push to Open drawer runners It adopts an upgraded version of the rebounder structure, which is responsive, strong and flexible, no need to pull hands,saying goodbye to the traditional handle drawer. The drawer can be opened by pressing lightly.double rows of solid steel balls make the drawer open smoother and quieter.</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Detachable &amp; full extension There is a black plastic buckle on the back of the slide rail, and the drawer can be easily taken out by pressing it，Easy to install. 3-Fold full extension drawer runners, so that the drawer can be fully drawn out, which is convenient for storing items.</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Good load bearing and rust resistance Made of 1.2mm high-density thickened steel.The bearing capacity can be as high as 45 kg.Has excellent anti-rust function,surface electrophoresis treatment. The electrophoretic layer prevents air from directly contacting the rail steel plate, thereby resisting oxidation and improving corrosion resistance.</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Installation requirements Length: 300mm（12inch)— Fully extended length:582mm(23 inch).installation clearance: 12.5mm(Each). Comes with mounting screws.It can meet the needs of various household drawers.There are other sizes available soft close drawer runners slides 300 350 400 450 500 550 600 mm Optional.</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Note For the drawer with outer cover, please reserve 1cm buffer position on the inner side of the panel to avoid the normal use of the slide function that affects the drawer slides. （Note: The drawer must be able to be pushed inward by 1 cm. Implement push to open function.）If you have any questions or problems, please feel free to contact us.</span></li>\r\n</ul>', 'Jadespace Push to Open Drawer Slides – Full Extension Ball Bearing Drawer Runners | Handleless Drawer System | 45kg Load Capacity | 300–600mm Sizes', '<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1733\">Create a sleek, handle-free furniture design with the <strong data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1304\">Jadespace Push to Open Drawer Slides</strong>. Designed with an advanced <strong data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1366\">push-to-open rebound mechanism</strong>, these premium <strong data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1428\">full-extension ball bearing drawer runners</strong> allow drawers to open effortlessly with a gentle press—no handles required. Manufactured from <strong data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1545\">high-density steel</strong>, supporting up to <strong data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1572\">45kg</strong>, and tested for <strong data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1627\">100,000 opening and closing cycles</strong>, they are ideal for modular kitchens, wardrobes, office furniture, TV units, and modern storage cabinets.</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"table table-borderless table-sm\" style=\"height: 180px;\" width=\"634\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Brand</td>\r\n<td>Jadespace</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Material</td>\r\n<td>Aluminum</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Colour</td>\r\n<td>Black</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Finish Type</td>\r\n<td>Steel</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Mounting Type</td>\r\n<td>Side Mount</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'push-to-open-drawer', '', '', '2026-07-27 19:58:42', '2026-07-27 19:58:42', '', 0, 'https://jadespaceglobal.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=545', 0, 'product', '', 0),
