(575, 1, '2024-11-10 10:12:46', '2024-11-10 10:12:46', '<h4><strong>About this item</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">GOOD DURABILITY This premium glass door bottom lock patch fitting is made of rust-free stainless steel, resists water and work for lifetime. The brushed surface is smoothly treated, they can be used from Normal to Toughened Glass Doors.</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">EASY TO INSTALL The package contains compatible installation fixtures for easy and quality installation that can meet your needs. The patch material is sufficient, the force area is large, the load-bearing performance is strong, and it is not easy to deform.</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">MODERN STYLISH Simple shape, beautiful appearance. Premium matt finish, suitable for a variety of door styles. Meet your aesthetic needs and add a touch of sophistication to your office/home.</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">WIDE APPLICATION This glass door bottom lock patch fitting is suitable for installation on various types of glass doors. Suitable for home and business use. They are ideal for office room doors, entrance doors, bedroom doors etc.</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">PACKAGE INCLUDES 1 Pc Glass Door Bottom Lock Fitting, 3 Keys &amp; ​Authenticity Card</span></li>\r\n</ul>', 'Glass Door Bottom Lock Fitting', '<table class=\"table table-borderless table-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Brand</td>\r\n<td>Jadespace</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Manufacturer</td>\r\n<td>Jadespace</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Country of Origin</td>\r\n<td>India</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Model number</td>\r\n<td>‎JSG-BL1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Number of Memory Sticks</td>\r\n<td>1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Product Dimensions</td>\r\n<td>‎10 x 5 x 4 cm</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Item mo