(661, 1, '2026-07-26 15:04:04', '2026-07-26 15:04:04', '<h3 class=\"XYd-Qa_Headline PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-w-component=\"title\" data-w-weight=\"semibold\" data-w-size=\"lg\">Premium Hydraulic Wardrobe Lift for Effortless Access</h3>\n<p class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text\" data-w-component=\"text\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">The <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Jadespace Adjustable Pull-Down Wardrobe Lift</span> is an innovative wardrobe accessory designed to transform difficult-to-reach upper hanging areas into fully accessible storage. Whether used in modular wardrobes, walk-in closets, luxury bedroom furniture, or dressing rooms, this pull-down system provides exceptional convenience, organization, and space efficiency.</p>\n<p class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text\" data-w-component=\"text\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Featuring a <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">telescopic adjustable rail (920–1240mm)</span>, the lift can be customized to fit a wide range of wardrobe sizes. The premium <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">hydraulic pneumatic buffer mechanism</span> allows the hanging rail to be pulled down smoothly and returned gently to its original position without sudden movement.</p>\n<p class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text\" data-w-component=\"text\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Constructed from high-quality <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">aluminium alloy</span>, the wardrobe lift offers excellent strength, corrosion resistance, and long-lasting durability while maintaining a lightweight structure. The elegant <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Mocha finish</span> complements contemporary wardrobe interiors and premium furniture designs.</p>\n<p class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text\" data-w-component=\"text\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">With a <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">25kg maximum load capacity</span>, the system is ideal for shirts, coats, jackets, sarees, dresses, trousers, and everyday garments. By utilizing the upper section of the wardrobe, it frees up valuable lower space for drawers, shoe racks, shelves, and storage baskets.</p>\n\n<h4><strong>About this item</strong></h4>\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Adjustable –Suitable for wardrobe inner width: approx 920 to 1240mm. The width of tube can be adjusted due to its telescopic design so that it fits wardrobe well.</span></li>\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Premium Material - Our Pull Down Closet Rods is mainly made of aluminium tube, sturdy and durable, with strong load capacity, max load to up 13Kgs. this wardrobe rail adopts pneumatic buffer system, the arm will go back to the high place softly.</span></li>\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Pull Down Design - This Wardrobe Rail Lift adopts pneumatic buffer system, makes you easy to hang or take clothes whereby you can easily reach the things you need，and hang clothes on or pick up conveniently，in addition,pull the arm gently to make the rail in the horizontal position, clothes can be hung up in the upper part of the wardrobe, leaving room in the bottom part for racks or shelves</span></li>\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Space Saving - Make full use of the high place which we can\'t reach to, save space of your closet. our wardrobe lift hanger gives the ability to mount the rails higher than can be reached due to the pull down hydraulic system.</span></li>\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Good Performance - Use our wardrobe lift organizer that clothes can be hung up in the upper part of the wardrobe, leaving room in the bottom part for racks or shelves with easy putting in and taking out without steps or other aids.</span></li>\n</ul>', 'Jadespace Adjustable Pull-Down Wardrobe Lift – Soft-Close Hydraulic Clothes Lifter for Closets | 920–1240mm Adjustable Width | Mocha | 25kg Load Capacity', '<p class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-w-component=\"text\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Make the most of your wardrobe\'s upper storage space with the <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Jadespace Adjustable Pull-Down Wardrobe Lift</span>. Designed for wardrobes with <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">920–1240mm internal width</span>, this premium hydraulic clothes lifter features a <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">soft-close pneumatic buffer system</span>, durable <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">aluminium construction</span>, telescopic width adjustment, and a stylish <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Mocha finish</span>. With a <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">25kg load capacity</span>, it allows effortless access to hanging clothes while maximizing vertical wardrobe storage.</p>\n\n<div class=\"duPRdW_Divider\" data-w-component=\"divider\"></div>\n<table class=\"table table-borderless table-sm\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Brand</td>\n<td>Jadespace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Colour</td>\n<td>Mocha</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Product Dimensions</td>\n<td>86L x 16W Centimeters</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material</td>\n<td>Metal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mounting Type</td>\n<td>Side</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Weight</td>\n<td>3500 Grams</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Maximum Weight</td>\n<td>25 Kilograms</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '389-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-07-26 15:04:04', '2026-07-26 15:04:04', '', 389, 'https://jadespaceglobal.com/?p=661', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
