(676, 1, '2026-07-25 02:53:58', '2026-07-25 02:53:58', '<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1lzm1x8\" data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1711\">Premium Pull-Out Wardrobe Organizer for Trousers, Sarees &amp; Accessories</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"2076\">The <strong data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1770\">Jadespace Pull-Out Trouser &amp; Saree Rack with Tray</strong> is designed to bring premium organization and effortless accessibility to modern wardrobes. Combining elegant design with precision engineering, this wardrobe storage system helps you neatly arrange trousers, sarees, ties, belts, scarves, and fashion accessories while maximizing available wardrobe space.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2371\">Equipped with a <strong data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2156\">German-engineered full-extension side undermount mechanism</strong>, the rack glides smoothly and quietly, providing complete access to your garments. The integrated <strong data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2280\">soft-close technology</strong> ensures gentle and silent closing, preventing slamming and enhancing long-term durability.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2673\">The <strong data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2417\">powder-coated heavy-duty metal frame</strong> offers outstanding strength and stability while supporting up to <strong data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2491\">30kg</strong> of weight. The built-in storage tray is perfect for watches, wallets, jewellery, socks, handkerchiefs, belts, and other small accessories, keeping everything organized in one place.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2879\">Available in <strong data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2723\">600mm and 900mm wardrobe widths</strong>, this pull-out organizer is an excellent alternative to conventional wooden shelves, adding both functionality and a premium aesthetic to modern wardrobes.</p>\n\n<h4><strong>About this item</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Set contains Pull out Mechanism, Handle built-in Metal frame, Wardrobe Trouser and Saree Rack with tray and clips</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Allows easy access by a full extension Side undermount mechanism which is made in Germany</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">German soft close mechanism gives nice and gentle movement</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Powder coated heavy metal frame for effortless functionality</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Organise your clothes in a better way with this pull-out for wardrobes</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Wardrobe Trouser and Saree Rack with tray Pull out is available in 600mm and 900mm</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Ideal for hanging trousers, saree, ties, belts and storing small accessories in the given trays</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Functional and visually pleasing alternative to wooden shelves, in Wardrobes</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Maximum Weight Capacity - 30 Kgs</li>\n</ul>', 'Jadespace Pull-Out Trouser & Saree Rack with Tray | Soft Close Wardrobe Organizer | German Side Undermount Mechanism | 30kg Capacity | Available in 600mm & 900mm', 'Keep your wardrobe perfectly organized with the <strong data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1193\">Jadespace Pull-Out Trouser &amp; Saree Rack with Tray</strong>. Designed with a <strong data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1269\">German-engineered soft-close side undermount mechanism</strong>, this premium wardrobe organizer features a heavy-duty powder-coated metal frame, built-in storage tray, integrated handle, and dedicated clips for trousers, sarees, ties, belts, scarves, and accessories. Available in <strong data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1507\">600mm and 900mm</strong> sizes with a <strong data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1543\">30kg load capacity</strong>, it is the ideal storage solution for modern wardrobes.\n<table class=\"table table-borderless table-sm\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Brand</td>\n<td>Jadespace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SKU</td>\n<td>MWS-PS-26</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Available in</td>\n<td>600 mm and 900 mm</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '540-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-07-25 02:53:58', '2026-07-25 02:53:58', '', 540, 'https://jadespaceglobal.com/?p=676', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(677, 1, '2026-07-26 15:12:54', '2026-07-26 15:12:54', '<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"13mxbmf\" data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1736\">Premium Rolling Shutter for Modern Modular Kitchens</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1738\" data-end=\"2073\">The <strong data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1783\">Jadespace White Glass Rolling Shutter</strong> combines elegant aesthetics with intelligent functionality, offering a premium solution for modern modular kitchens. Unlike conventional hinged or sliding cabinet doors, the rolling shutter retracts smoothly into the cabinet, providing complete and unobstructed access to the storage area.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2429\">Manufactured using <strong data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2124\">premium Flexi-Glass panels</strong> and a durable <strong data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2167\">aluminium rolling system</strong>, this shutter delivers smooth, reliable performance while adding a sophisticated white finish to your kitchen interiors. Its <strong data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2320\">anywhere-stop mechanism</strong> allows the shutter to remain open at any desired position, offering greater flexibility during everyday use.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2746\">Designed for cabinets measuring <strong data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2514\">600mm (Width) × 1320mm (Height) × 300mm (Depth)</strong>, it is ideal for creating stylish appliance garages, coffee stations, crockery units, pantry storage, and breakfast cabinets. The space-saving design eliminates door swing clearance, making it especially useful in compact kitchens.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2748\" data-end=\"2959\">With corrosion-resistant aluminium profiles and a modern minimalist appearance, the Jadespace Rolling Shutter is a perfect addition to contemporary homes, luxury apartments, and premium modular kitchen projects.</p>\n\n<h4><strong>About this item</strong></h4>\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Set includes rolling mechanism, side profile and top profile cover</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Flexi-glass material is used for manufacturing glass rolling shutter</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Rolling Shutters are designed to give complete openings in cabinets with anywhere stop feature</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Great alternative to traditional hinged or sliding doors</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Rolling Shutters leave your kitchen transformed and reward it with the luxury of space</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Rolling shutters are generally used as an appliance garage or a crockery unit</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Elegantly designed to suit today\'s modern kitchen</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Organize kitchen products as desired with our premium aluminium rolling shutter</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Cabinet of 600mm (Width) X 1320mm (Height) X 300mm (Depth) required for installation</li>\n</ul>', 'Jadespace White Glass Rolling Shutter for Kitchen Cabinet – 600 × 1320 × 300mm | Premium Flexi-Glass Tambour Door | Aluminium Soft Rolling System', 'Enhance your modular kitchen with the <strong data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1284\">Jadespace White Glass Rolling Shutter</strong>, a premium <strong data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1331\">Flexi-Glass tambour door system</strong> designed for <strong data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1376\">600mm wide kitchen cabinets</strong>. Featuring a high-quality aluminium rolling mechanism with an <strong data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1465\">anywhere-stop function</strong>, this elegant shutter opens smoothly without occupying extra space, making it ideal for appliance garages, crockery units, pantry cabinets, and modern kitchen storage solutions.\n<table class=\"table table-borderless table-sm\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Brand</td>\n<td>Jadespace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SKU</td>\n<td>MRS - 050</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Available in</td>\n<td>Aluminium, Black Glass and White Glass</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '527-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-07-26 15:12:54', '2026-07-26 15:12:54', '', 527, 'https://jadespaceglobal.com/?p=677', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(678, 1, '2026-07-25 02:40:56', '2026-07-25 02:40:56', '<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"lhqfi9\" data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1299\">Premium Rolling Shutter Cabinet for Modern Modular Kitchens</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1634\">The <strong data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1364\">Jadespace Black PVC Rolling Shutter for Kitchen Cabinet</strong> is a stylish and practical storage solution designed for modern homes. Featuring a premium black finish, durable PVC shutter construction, and precision-engineered aluminium side profiles, this cabinet system combines functionality, durability, and contemporary design.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1876\">Unlike traditional cabinet doors that require additional opening space, the rolling shutter mechanism glides smoothly within the side channels, making it an ideal solution for compact kitchens where efficient space utilization is essential.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"2193\">The premium PVC shutter panels are lightweight, moisture-resistant, and easy to maintain, while the aluminium side profile ensures stable and long-lasting operation. The smooth rolling system allows effortless opening and closing, providing quick access to stored items while keeping the kitchen neat and organized.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2420\">Ideal for storing kitchen appliances, mixers, coffee machines, groceries, utensils, jars, and pantry essentials, this rolling shutter cabinet creates a clean and modern kitchen environment while maximizing storage efficiency.</p>\n\n<h4><strong>About this item</strong></h4>\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Set includes rolling mechanism, side profile and top profile cover</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Pure Aluminium raw material is used for manufacturing rolling shutter</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Rolling Shutters are designed to give complete openings in cabinets with anywhere stop feature</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Great alternative to traditional hinged or sliding doors</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Rolling Shutters leave your kitchen transformed and reward it with the luxury of space</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Rolling shutters are generally used as an appliance garage or a crockery unit</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Elegantly designed to suit today\'s modern kitchen</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Organize kitchen products as desired with our premium aluminium rolling shutter</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Cabinet of 600mm (Width) X 1320mm (Height) X 300mm (Depth) required for installation</li>\n</ul>', 'Jadespace Black PVC Rolling Shutter for Kitchen Cabinet – 600mm x 1320mm x 300mm | Modular Aluminium Side Profile with Smooth Rolling Mechanism', 'Enhance the functionality and appearance of your modular kitchen with the <strong data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"867\">Jadespace Black PVC Rolling Shutter Cabinet System</strong>. Designed with premium PVC shutter slats, durable aluminium side profiles, and a smooth rolling mechanism, this modern storage solution provides easy access while maintaining a sleek and clutter-free kitchen. Perfect for storing appliances, groceries, kitchen accessories, and everyday essentials in contemporary modular kitchens.\n<table class=\"table table-borderless table-sm\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Brand</td>\n<td>Jadespace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SKU</td>\n<td>MRS - 048</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Available in</td>\n<td>Black Glass, White Glass and Frosted Glass</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '524-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-07-25 02:40:56', '2026-07-25 02:40:56', '', 524, 'https://jadespaceglobal.com/?p=678', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(679, 1, '2026-07-25 02:48:29', '2026-07-25 02:48:29', '<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1r5goau\" data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1526\">Smart Pull-Out Waste Bin for Modern Modular Kitchens</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1823\">The <strong data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1588\">Jadespace Plastic Kitchen Sliding Pull-Out Waste Bin</strong> is a practical and hygienic waste management solution designed for contemporary modular kitchens. Installed inside the cabinet, the pull-out design keeps the dust bin hidden from view, helping maintain a clean and uncluttered kitchen.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"2096\">Manufactured from high-quality, durable plastic in an elegant grey finish, the waste bin is lightweight, easy to clean, and built for daily use. The precision sliding mechanism allows smooth operation, making it easy to dispose of kitchen waste while cooking or cleaning.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2281\">Designed for <strong data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2133\">250 × 452 × 365 mm</strong> dimensions and compatible with <strong data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2188\">254mm cabinet width</strong>, this pull-out dust bin is ideal for compact kitchens where space optimization is essential.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2463\">Whether you\'re disposing of vegetable peels, food scraps, packaging, or everyday household waste, the Jadespace Sliding Waste Bin offers a convenient, durable, and modern solution.</p>\n\n<h4><strong>About this item</strong></h4>\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Set includes metal frame with mechanism, ABS buckets and lid.</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Kitchen pullout built-in wastebin/dustbin for Undersink cabinet has 30 Litres capacity which is divided into 2 partitions with 15 litres capacity each &amp; with soft closing mechanism</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Removable bucket for convenience of cleaning.</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Full extension slides provided for easy access of the buckets.</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Elegantly designed to suit today’s modern kitchen.</li>\n</ul>', 'Jadespace Plastic Pull-Out Kitchen Waste Bin – Grey | Cabinet Mounted Dust Bin | Soft Sliding Trash Bin | 250 × 452 × 365 mm | Fits 254mm Cabinet Width', 'Maintain a clean and organized kitchen with the <strong data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1154\">Jadespace Plastic Kitchen Sliding Pull-Out Waste Bin</strong>. Designed for <strong data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1192\">254mm cabinet width</strong>, this cabinet-mounted waste bin features a smooth sliding mechanism, durable plastic construction, and a space-saving pull-out design. Ideal for modern modular kitchens, it keeps waste concealed while providing quick and convenient access.\n<table class=\"table table-borderless table-sm\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Brand</td>\n<td>Jadespace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SKU</td>\n<td>MKE - 0106</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Capacity</td>\n<td>30 Litres</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '515-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-07-25 02:48:29', '2026-07-25 02:48:29', '', 515, 'https://jadespaceglobal.com/?p=679', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(680, 1, '2026-07-27 20:03:00', '2026-07-27 20:03:00', '<h4><strong>About this item</strong></h4>\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Set contains Mechanism, Pull out system, Door frame, Clips, Baskets (8 or 12 depending on model)</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Each small basket have capacity upto 6 kg and Big basket have capacity upto 10 kg</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Pantry Minimum Capacity 60 kg and Maximum Capacity 100 kg depending on model</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Powder-coated Frame in Light Grey Finish</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Basket made of Chrome plated mild steel and Laminated wooden base</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Baskets are height adjustable &amp; easily removable for cleaning purpose</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Elegantly designed to suit today\'s modern kitchen</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Organize kitchen products as desired with our premium kitchen pantry system</li>\n</ul>', 'Jadespace Satin Pantry Premium System 450mm – Soft-Close Tall Pull-Out Kitchen Pantry | Adjustable Storage Baskets | 60–100kg Load Capacity', '<table class=\"table table-borderless table-sm\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Brand</td>\n<td>Jadespace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SKU</td>\n<td>MKM-040.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Available in</td>\n<td>450mm and 600 mm width with options for 8 basket or 12 baskets height</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '505-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-07-27 20:03:00', '2026-07-27 20:03:00', '', 505, 'https://jadespaceglobal.com/?p=680', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
