(897, 1, '2026-07-22 20:06:23', '2026-07-22 20:06:23', '<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"drkyrh\" data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1617\">Premium Stainless Steel Dish Rack for Modern Modular Kitchens</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1957\">The <strong data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1675\">Jadespace Premium Stainless Steel Dish Rack GTPT</strong> is engineered to provide a hygienic, organized, and space-saving solution for modern modular kitchens. Manufactured using high-quality <strong data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"1843\">AISI 430/304 stainless steel</strong>, this cabinet-mounted dish rack delivers exceptional durability, corrosion resistance, and long-term performance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"2180\">Designed to fit <strong data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2009\">600mm modular kitchen cabinets</strong>, this premium <strong data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2049\">3-piece dish rack set</strong> includes a <strong data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2075\">plate rack</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2099\">glass &amp; cup holder</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2118\">drip tray</strong>, offering complete dish organization in one compact solution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2452\">The intelligently designed plate rack securely holds <strong data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2261\">up to 20 dinner plates</strong>, while the dedicated glass holder keeps cups, glasses, and mugs safely organized. The removable drip tray efficiently collects excess water, helping maintain a clean and dry kitchen cabinet.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2587\">Its elegant polished finish complements contemporary modular kitchen interiors while providing easy cleaning and minimal maintenance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2736\">Whether for new modular kitchens or kitchen renovations, the Jadespace Dish Rack combines premium quality, functionality, and sophisticated design.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>About this item</strong></h4>\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\r\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Supply includes: 1 rack for 20 dishes, 1 rack for glasses y 1 dropsholder tray.</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Easy installation and strong fastening: assembly with 8 lateral tensioners that tighten trays to the cabinet.</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Racks for plates and glasses made of stainless steel AISI 430</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Dropsholder tray made of stainless steel AISI 304.</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">IMPORTANT: Check two measurements to make sure if it fits your furniture: external width of the cabinet and internal width of the cabinet. This dish drainer is suitable for installation in 70cm wide units with an inside width of between 635 and 670mm to fit.</span></li>\r\n</ul>', 'Jadespace Premium Stainless Steel Dish Rack GTPT – 600mm Modular Kitchen Cabinet Organizer | 20 Plate & Glass Holders | Rust-Proof AISI 430/304 Steel | Set of 3 Pieces', '<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1514\">Keep your modular kitchen clean, organized, and efficient with the <strong data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1181\">Jadespace Premium Stainless Steel Dish Rack GTPT</strong>. Designed for <strong data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1222\">600mm kitchen cabinets</strong>, this <strong data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1262\">3-piece dish drying organizer</strong> features <strong data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1292\">20-plate storage</strong>, dedicated <strong data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1321\">glass holders</strong>, premium <strong data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1376\">AISI 430/304 stainless steel construction</strong>, and a <strong data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1405\">rust-proof finish</strong>. Perfect for drying and organizing plates, bowls, cups, and kitchen utensils while maximizing cabinet space.</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"table table-borderless table-sm\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Brand</td>\r\n<td>Jadespace</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Material</td>\r\n<td>Stainless Steel</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Product Dimensions</td>\r\n<td>600D x 30W x 320H Millimeters</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Colour</td>\r\n<td>Silver</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Recommended Uses For Product</td>\r\n<td>Rust Proof</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '542-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-07-22 20:06:23', '2026-07-22 20:06:23', '', 542, 'https://jadespaceglobal.com/?p=897', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
