(1020, 1, '2026-07-11 09:46:53', '2026-07-11 09:46:53', '<h4><strong>About this item</strong></h4>\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Durable Construction: Crafted from premium stainless steel, the LAPO kitchen Thali+Dish+Soucer rack is designed for durability and long-lasting use. The wide base is made of durable ABS plastic which makes the stand super stable.</span></li>\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Perfect Fit For Tandem Boxes: Measuring 18.5 inches, it\'s specifically tailored for a 20-inch tandem box, optimizing kitchen space without overcrowding.</span></li>\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Chrome Finish: The Lapo Stainless steel kitchen Organizer is finished with an additional layer of nickel-chrome coating. This makes it an anti-rust dish stand for the kitchen. The plate stand can hold small plates, saucers, muffin tins, cookie sheets, cake pans and more!</span></li>\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Multipupose Use: Not just for dishes, this kitchen rack stands work as a sink drainer, allowing water to evaporate quickly from freshly washed dishes.</span></li>\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Package Includes: 1 Piece Saucer/ Rakabi Stand, 1 Piece Dish Stand, 1 Piece Thali Stand. With this utensil holder, you don\'t have to worry about DIY or installation. The LAPO Dish Stand comes pre-assembled in the box. You can start using it right away.</span></li>\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Size Specification: Thali Rack - L-18.5.5 Inch, B-6 Inch, H-8 Inch( 9 Sections), Dish Rack - L-18.5 Inch, B-6 Inch, H-6 Inch( 11 Sections), Soucer Rack - L-18.5 Inch, B-6 Inch, H-4 Inch( 13 Sections)</span></li>\n</ul>', 'Stand for Tandem', '<table class=\"table table-borderless table-sm\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Brand</td>\n<td>Jadespace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material</td>\n<td>Stainless Steel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Colour</td>\n<td>Chrome</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Feature</td>\n<td>Multipurpose</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Product Dimensions</td>\n<td>47D x 14.5W x 20H Centimeters</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shelf Type</td>\n<td>Tiered Shelf</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '357-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-07-11 09:46:53', '2026-07-11 09:46:53', '', 357, 'https://jadespaceglobal.com/?p=1020', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1022, 1, '2026-07-25 02:59:43', '2026-07-25 02:59:43', '<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"9tzk8c\" data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1627\">Premium Pull-Out Pantry Storage for Modern Modular Kitchens</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1965\">The <strong data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1674\">Jadespace Satin Pantry Premium System</strong> is a premium modular kitchen storage solution designed to provide maximum organization, effortless accessibility, and elegant aesthetics. Built with <strong data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1856\">German soft-close technology</strong>, the pantry glides smoothly and quietly, ensuring a premium user experience every time you open or close it.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2231\">The system includes a complete pull-out mechanism, door frame, and <strong data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2071\">8 or 12 removable storage baskets</strong> (depending on the selected model). Each basket is fully height-adjustable, allowing you to customize the storage layout according to your kitchen requirements.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2563\">Manufactured using a combination of <strong data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2345\">premium stainless steel, ABS, aluminium, and a powder-coated steel frame</strong>, the pantry offers exceptional strength, corrosion resistance, and long-term durability. The baskets can be easily removed for cleaning, making maintenance simple while helping maintain a hygienic kitchen environment.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2828\">With an overall storage capacity ranging from <strong data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2628\">60kg to 100kg</strong> (depending on the model), this pantry system is ideal for organizing groceries, dry foods, jars, bottles, containers, spices, snacks, cereals, and other kitchen essentials in one convenient location.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2967\">Its sleek <strong data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2866\">dark grey matte finish</strong> complements contemporary modular kitchen interiors, delivering both functionality and premium style.</p>\n\n<h4><strong>About this item</strong></h4>\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Set contains Mechanism, Pull out system, Door frame, Baskets (8 or 12 depending on model)</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">German Technology soft close mechanism which gives nice and gentle movement</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Each small basket have capacity upto 6 kg and Big basket have capacity upto 10 kg</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\"><strong>Pantry Minimum Capacity 60 kg and Maximum Capacity 100 kg depending on model</strong></li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Powder-coated Frame in Dark Grey Matt Finish</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Basket made of Stainless steel, ABS and Aluminium</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Baskets are height adjustable &amp; easily removable for cleaning purpose</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Elegantly designed to suit today\'s modern kitchen</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Organize kitchen products as desired with our premium kitchen pantry system</li>\n</ul>', 'Jadespace Satin Pantry Premium System | Soft Close Pull-Out Kitchen Pantry | German Technology | Adjustable Storage Baskets | 60–100kg Capacity', 'Maximize your kitchen storage with the <strong data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1124\">Jadespace Satin Pantry Premium System</strong>, a premium pull-out pantry organizer designed for modern modular kitchens. Equipped with <strong data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1257\">German-engineered soft-close technology</strong>, a durable <strong data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1302\">dark grey powder-coated frame</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1353\">height-adjustable stainless steel baskets</strong>, this pantry system provides smooth operation, exceptional storage capacity, and elegant organization for groceries, jars, bottles, spices, and everyday kitchen essentials.\n<table class=\"table table-borderless table-sm\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Brand</td>\n<td>Jadespace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SKU</td>\n<td>MKM-040.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Available in</td>\n<td>450mm and 600 mm width with options for 8 basket or 12 baskets height</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '502-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-07-25 02:59:43', '2026-07-25 02:59:43', '', 502, 'https://jadespaceglobal.com/?p=1022', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1023, 1, '2026-07-26 14:05:03', '2026-07-26 14:05:03', '<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"9fjo6o\" data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1693\">Premium Sliding Shoe Storage Solution for Modern Wardrobes</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1986\">The <strong data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1731\">Jadespace Pull-Out Shoe Rack</strong> is a premium wardrobe accessory designed for homeowners who value organization, convenience, and elegant design. Instead of stacking shoes on shelves, this pull-out system allows you to neatly arrange multiple pairs while providing quick and easy access.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2255\">Equipped with a <strong data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2055\">German full-extension side undermount mechanism</strong>, the rack glides out smoothly, allowing complete visibility of every pair. The integrated <strong data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2171\">soft-close technology</strong> ensures quiet, controlled closing, protecting both the mechanism and your wardrobe.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2537\">Constructed from a <strong data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2316\">powder-coated heavy-duty metal frame</strong>, the shoe rack offers exceptional strength and durability while supporting up to <strong data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2406\">30kg</strong>. The integrated handle makes operation effortless, while the sturdy shoe holders securely accommodate different types of footwear.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2839\">Available in <strong data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2587\">600mm and 900mm wardrobe widths</strong>, this organizer is ideal for formal shoes, sneakers, loafers, sandals, heels, slippers, and children\'s footwear. It is a practical and stylish alternative to traditional wooden shelves, helping create a clean, organized, and premium wardrobe interior.</p>\n\n<h4><strong>About this item</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Set contains Pull out Mechanism, Handle built-in Metal frame, Shoe Rack and clips</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Allows easy access by a full extension Side undermount mechanism which is made in Germany</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">German soft close mechanism gives nice and gentle movement</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Powder coated heavy metal frame for effortless functionality</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Organise your shoes in a better way with this pull-out for wardrobes</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Wardrobe Shoe Rack Pull out is available in 600mm and 900mm</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Ideal for storing variety of shoes such as formal shoes, casual shoes, ladies sandals etc</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Functional and visually pleasing alternative to wooden shelves, in Wardrobes</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Maximum Weight Capacity - 30 Kgs</li>\n</ul>', 'Jadespace Pull-Out Shoe Rack for Wardrobe | German Soft Close Sliding Organizer | Heavy-Duty Metal Frame | 30kg Capacity | Available in 600mm & 900mm', 'Upgrade your wardrobe with the <strong data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1126\">Jadespace Pull-Out Shoe Rack</strong>, designed to keep your footwear neatly organized while maximizing storage space. Featuring a <strong data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1282\">German-engineered full-extension side undermount mechanism</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1309\">soft-close technology</strong>, a <strong data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1353\">powder-coated heavy-duty metal frame</strong>, and an integrated pull handle, this premium wardrobe organizer provides smooth operation and effortless access. Available in <strong data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1499\">600mm and 900mm</strong> sizes with a <strong data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1535\">30kg load capacity</strong>, it is the perfect storage solution for modern wardrobes.\n<table class=\"table table-borderless table-sm\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Brand</td>\n<td>Jadespace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SKU</td>\n<td>MWS-PS-28</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Available in</td>\n<td>600 mm and 900 mm</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '538-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-07-26 14:05:03', '2026-07-26 14:05:03', '', 538, 'https://jadespaceglobal.com/?p=1023', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1024, 1, '2026-07-26 14:22:10', '2026-07-26 14:22:10', '<h3 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1or93jv\" data-start=\"2623\" data-end=\"2660\">Multiple Force Options (60N–150N)</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2758\">Available in <strong data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2708\">60N, 80N, 100N, 120N, and 150N</strong> to suit different cabinet door sizes and weights.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"\" data-section-id=\"10oqgnd\" data-start=\"2760\" data-end=\"2793\">Smooth Hydraulic Lift Support</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2882\">Advanced hydraulic mechanism provides controlled lifting and soft, stable door movement.</p>\n\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4cm9sw\" data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2912\">Quiet &amp; Silent Operation</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"3015\">Minimizes noise and prevents sudden door drops, creating a safer and more comfortable user experience.</p>\n\n<h3 data-section-id=\"at6e0z\" data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3047\">Durable Metal Construction</h3>\n<p data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3144\">Manufactured from premium-grade steel for excellent strength, durability, and long service life.</p>\n\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8qlq7j\" data-start=\"3146\" data-end=\"3190\">Corrosion-Resistant Metallic Grey Finish</h3>\n<p data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3290\">Protective finish resists rust, moisture, and daily wear, making it ideal for kitchen environments.</p>\n\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tix5v8\" data-start=\"3292\" data-end=\"3313\">Easy Installation</h3>\n<p data-start=\"3314\" data-end=\"3406\">Supplied with standard mounting hardware for quick and secure installation on cabinet doors.</p>\n\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19jv3vr\" data-start=\"3408\" data-end=\"3443\">Supports Cabinet Door Longevity</h3>\n<p data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3528\">Reduces stress on hinges and cabinet frames by controlling door movement and impact.</p>\n\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14emj9t\" data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3555\">Universal Application</h3>\n<p data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3658\">Compatible with most modular kitchen cabinets, wardrobes, office cabinets, and overhead storage units.</p>\n\n<h4><strong>About this item</strong></h4>\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Ideally used for the kitchen overhead cabinets where the entire cabinet space can be utilized.</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Smooth shutter opening &amp; closing</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Suitable for wooden &amp; aluminium framed shutters</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Load Size: 60N, 80N, 100N, 120N, 150N</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Surface Color: Metallic Grey</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">Easy installation</li>\n 	<li class=\"O2\">High durability</li>\n</ul>', 'Jadespace Hydraulic Gas Pump – Premium Hydraulic Lift Support for Kitchen Cabinets | 60N–150N | Soft Open Gas Spring | Easy Installation | Metallic Grey Finish', 'Upgrade your modular kitchen and wardrobe cabinets with the <strong data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1261\">Jadespace Premium Hydraulic Gas Pump</strong>. Designed for <strong data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1324\">smooth, controlled, and silent door movement</strong>, this high-performance lift support is available in <strong data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1411\">60N, 80N, 100N, 120N, and 150N</strong> force options. Featuring a durable metallic grey finish, corrosion-resistant construction, and easy installation, it is the ideal solution for overhead cabinet doors and flap lifts.\n<table class=\"table table-borderless table-sm\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Brand</td>\n<td>Jadespace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SKU</td>\n<td>MUL - 508</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weight Capacity</td>\n<td>60 Newton / 6 Kg</td>\n<td>80 Newton / 8 Kg</td>\n<td>100 Newton / 10 Kg</td>\n<td>120 Newton / 12 Kg</td>\n<td>150 Newton / 15 Kg</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '483-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-07-26 14:22:10', '2026-07-26 14:22:10', '', 483, 'https://jadespaceglobal.com/?p=1024', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1025, 1, '2026-07-26 14:32:09', '2026-07-26 14:32:09', '<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"kbuz4l\" data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1741\">Premium Cutlery Drawer Organizer for Modern Modular Kitchens</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"2038\">The <strong data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1793\">Jadespace Premium ABS Plastic Cutlery Tray</strong> is designed to bring organization, convenience, and elegance to modern modular kitchens. Its intelligently divided <strong data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1933\">7-compartment layout</strong> helps keep cutlery and kitchen tools neatly arranged, making everyday cooking and dining more efficient.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2284\">Manufactured from <strong data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2086\">high-quality ABS plastic</strong>, the tray is lightweight, durable, and resistant to everyday wear. The premium <strong data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2188\">silver grey finish</strong> complements contemporary kitchen interiors while the smooth surface allows effortless cleaning.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2679\">Designed to fit <strong data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2335\">60cm kitchen drawer carcasses</strong>, the tray measures <strong data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2373\">53 × 49 × 7 cm</strong> with a <strong data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2394\">3mm thick</strong> construction. For greater installation flexibility, the edges can be carefully trimmed by approximately <strong data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2530\">0.5 inches (around 12–13mm)</strong> where required, allowing better compatibility with selected drawer systems. <em data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2679\">(Always verify your drawer\'s internal dimensions before installation.)</em></p>\n<p data-start=\"2681\" data-end=\"2901\">Whether storing spoons, forks, knives, serving spoons, peelers, or other utensils, the Jadespace Cutlery Tray provides an organized and accessible storage solution that enhances both functionality and kitchen aesthetics.</p>\n\n<h4><strong>About this item</strong></h4>\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Tray Dimension: Width 53 cm x Depth 49 cm x Height 7 cm, Thickness: 3 MM (Please check your drawer size before buy) You can cut approximate 0.5 Inches round about according to your needs.</span></li>\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Design to fit 60 cm drawer Carcass width, Design Style: CLASSIC, Marden Luxury</span></li>\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Material: ABS material, protective film on the tray\'s surface Color: Silver grey, Thickness: 3 MM</span></li>\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">7 separate compartments to store forks and knifes, Nice drawer organizer to keep the tableware tidy and orderly.</span></li>\n</ul>', 'Jadespace Premium ABS Plastic Cutlery Tray – 7 Compartments | Silver Grey Kitchen Drawer Organizer | Fits 60cm Cabinet | Customizable Drawer Insert', 'Keep your kitchen drawers neat and clutter-free with the <strong data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1291\">Jadespace Premium ABS Plastic Cutlery Tray</strong>. Designed for <strong data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1346\">60cm modular kitchen drawer cabinets</strong>, this elegant <strong data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1388\">7-compartment organizer</strong> provides dedicated storage for spoons, forks, knives, serving tools, and other kitchen accessories. Made from premium ABS plastic with a stylish silver grey finish, the tray is durable, easy to clean, and can be trimmed slightly for a customized fit.\n<table class=\"table table-borderless table-sm\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Brand</td>\n<td>Jadespace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Specific Uses For Product</td>\n<td>inside</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material</td>\n<td>Plastic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Feature</td>\n<td>Durable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Finish Type</td>\n<td>Glossy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Product Dimensions</td>\n<td>49D x 54W x 7H Centimeters</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Capacity</td>\n<td>6 Cubic Inches</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '443-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-07-26 14:32:09', '2026-07-26 14:32:09', '', 443, 'https://jadespaceglobal.com/?p=1025', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1026, 1, '2026-07-27 19:56:53', '2026-07-27 19:56:53', '<h1 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1xw2um3\" data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1770\">Detailed Product Description</h1>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1rbasmx\" data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1837\">Premium Push-to-Open Drawer Runner System for Modern Furniture</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"2046\">The <strong data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1883\">Jadespace Push to Open Drawer Slides</strong> are designed for homeowners, interior designers, and furniture manufacturers who want a clean, minimalist, handleless appearance without compromising performance.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2361\">Unlike traditional drawer channels, these runners feature a <strong data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2157\">high-performance spring-loaded push mechanism</strong> that instantly opens the drawer with a light press. Combined with <strong data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2261\">precision ball-bearing technology</strong>, the slides deliver exceptionally smooth and quiet movement throughout the drawer\'s full extension.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2700\">Manufactured from <strong data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2415\">1.2mm thick high-density steel</strong> with an <strong data-start=\"2424\" data-end=\"2461\">electrophoretic anti-rust coating</strong>, the slides provide outstanding strength, corrosion resistance, and durability. Engineered to withstand <strong data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2580\">up to 45kg</strong> of load and independently tested for <strong data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"2646\">100,000 operating cycles</strong>, they are built for years of dependable everyday use.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2845\">A built-in <strong data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2744\">quick-release locking lever</strong> makes drawer removal and reinstallation simple, making maintenance and cleaning fast and convenient.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"3083\">Available in multiple sizes (<strong data-start=\"2876\" data-end=\"2931\">300mm, 350mm, 400mm, 450mm, 500mm, 550mm, and 600mm</strong>), these drawer runners are suitable for modular kitchens, wardrobes, office furniture, bathroom vanities, TV units, study tables, and storage cabinets.</p>\n\n<h4><strong>About this item</strong></h4>\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">30 Year service life Please note: This is push to open drawer slide，no soft close.YENUO push open drawer slides which is durable.After testing, the number of times the slide rail is opened and closed is as high as 100,000 times.Installation dimension description：25mm space between drawer and cabinet wall required ( Left mounting clearance: 12.5mm, right mounting clearance: 12.5mm ).Suitable drawer length:300-350 mm.</span></li>\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Push to Open drawer runners It adopts an upgraded version of the rebounder structure, which is responsive, strong and flexible, no need to pull hands,saying goodbye to the traditional handle drawer. The drawer can be opened by pressing lightly.double rows of solid steel balls make the drawer open smoother and quieter.</span></li>\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Detachable &amp; full extension There is a black plastic buckle on the back of the slide rail, and the drawer can be easily taken out by pressing it，Easy to install. 3-Fold full extension drawer runners, so that the drawer can be fully drawn out, which is convenient for storing items.</span></li>\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Good load bearing and rust resistance Made of 1.2mm high-density thickened steel.The bearing capacity can be as high as 45 kg.Has excellent anti-rust function,surface electrophoresis treatment. The electrophoretic layer prevents air from directly contacting the rail steel plate, thereby resisting oxidation and improving corrosion resistance.</span></li>\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Installation requirements Length: 300mm（12inch)— Fully extended length:582mm(23 inch).installation clearance: 12.5mm(Each). Comes with mounting screws.It can meet the needs of various household drawers.There are other sizes available soft close drawer runners slides 300 350 400 450 500 550 600 mm Optional.</span></li>\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Note For the drawer with outer cover, please reserve 1cm buffer position on the inner side of the panel to avoid the normal use of the slide function that affects the drawer slides. （Note: The drawer must be able to be pushed inward by 1 cm. Implement push to open function.）If you have any questions or problems, please feel free to contact us.</span></li>\n</ul>', 'Jadespace Push to Open Drawer Slides – Full Extension Ball Bearing Drawer Runners | Handleless Drawer System | 45kg Load Capacity | 300–600mm Sizes', '<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1733\">Create a sleek, handle-free furniture design with the <strong data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1304\">Jadespace Push to Open Drawer Slides</strong>. Designed with an advanced <strong data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1366\">push-to-open rebound mechanism</strong>, these premium <strong data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1428\">full-extension ball bearing drawer runners</strong> allow drawers to open effortlessly with a gentle press—no handles required. Manufactured from <strong data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1545\">high-density steel</strong>, supporting up to <strong data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1572\">45kg</strong>, and tested for <strong data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1627\">100,000 opening and closing cycles</strong>, they are ideal for modular kitchens, wardrobes, office furniture, TV units, and modern storage cabinets.</p>\n\n<table class=\"table table-borderless table-sm\" style=\"height: 180px;\" width=\"634\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Brand</td>\n<td>Jadespace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material</td>\n<td>Aluminum</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Colour</td>\n<td>Black</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Finish Type</td>\n<td>Steel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mounting Type</td>\n<td>Side Mount</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '545-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-07-27 19:56:53', '2026-07-27 19:56:53', '', 545, 'https://jadespaceglobal.com/?p=1026', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
